From: Farhan <farhanabdm@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 02:10:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(gi): custom images for imported characters

Imported custom characters can have their own avatar icons, banner
(background of character cards, team cards and the character page),
large character card, and talent and constellation icons, as image URLs.
Empty slots keep using the images of the "Images from" character.

The pack converter now records each character's image file names; in the
editor, pasting the URL of one image of the source site fills in the URLs
of all images. `--image-url` does the same in the converter.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
